content:
**Source:** Extracted from NANO_GENESIS_Commercial.txt

**Purpose:** Premium techniques for high-end product imagery with creative visual appeal

**Technique 1: Levitation/Floating Products**

```json
{
  "technique": "levitation_floating_product",
  "description": "Product appears to float in mid-air with dramatic lighting",
  "product": {
    "type": "wireless_headphones",
    "position": "floating horizontally, slight tilt for dynamism",
    "orientation": "ear cups facing camera at engaging angle",
    "height": "centered in frame, appearing weightless"
  },
  "visual_effect": {
    "suspension": "product floating with no visible support",
    "shadow": "soft shadow beneath product on invisible surface below",
    "physics": "slight upward movement suggested, defying gravity"
  },
  "lighting": {
    "style": "dramatic studio lighting with rim highlights",
    "key": "soft from camera-top-front",
    "rim": "strong rim light from behind creating bright edge glow",
    "fill": "minimal for dramatic shadow contrast",
    "special": "highlight along top edge of headphones for dimension"
  },
  "background": {
    "type": "gradient",
    "color_top": "dark gray or black (#1A1A1A)",
    "color_bottom": "slightly lighter gray (#2D2D2D)",
    "purpose": "dramatic, premium, makes product pop"
  },
  "mood": "premium, high-tech, futuristic, sophisticated"
}
```

**Imagen 3 Prompt:**
```markdown
"Floating wireless headphones product photography. Black premium headphones suspended in mid-air against dark gradient background. Product tilted dynamically at engaging angle. Dramatic studio lighting with bright rim lights creating edge glow. Soft shadow beneath suggesting invisible surface. High-tech, premium, futuristic mood. Commercial photography for luxury tech products."
```

**Technique 2: Splash Photography**

```json
{
  "technique": "splash_photography",
  "description": "Product with dynamic water/liquid splash for energy and freshness",
  "use_cases": ["waterproof products", "beverages", "fresh/clean product messaging"],
  "product": {
    "type": "waterproof_bluetooth_speaker",
    "position": "centered, stable on surface",
    "interaction": "water splashing around and over product"
  },
  "splash_element": {
    "liquid": "clear water",
    "motion": "dynamic splash frozen mid-action",
    "droplets": "water droplets in air, catching light",
    "coverage": "splashing around product, some droplets on product surface"
  },
  "lighting": {
    "style": "high-speed photography lighting",
    "key": "bright backlight to illuminate water droplets",
    "fill": "front light on product to show details",
    "effect": "water droplets glow and sparkle with backlighting"
  },
  "background": "dark (black or dark blue) to contrast with bright water",
  "technical": {
    "freeze_motion": "water appears frozen mid-splash",
    "sharpness": "product and all water droplets sharp",
    "timing": "peak splash moment for maximum drama"
  },
  "mood": "dynamic, fresh, energetic, action"
}
```

**Technique 3: Reflection Photography**

```json
{
  "technique": "reflection_surface_photography",
  "description": "Product on reflective surface (glass, water, polished stone) for premium aesthetic",
  "product": {
    "type": "premium_watch",
    "position": "on reflective black surface (black acrylic or glass)",
    "reflection": "clear mirror reflection visible below product"
  },
  "surface": {
    "material": "glossy black acrylic or glass",
    "reflection_quality": "clear, sharp mirror reflection",
    "wetness_optional": "subtle water droplets on surface for extra premium feel"
  },
  "lighting": {
    "key": "from above-front to light product without harsh reflections",
    "rim": "edge lighting to separate product from background",
    "surface_light": "subtle light on reflective surface to show its glossiness"
  },
  "background": {
    "type": "gradient behind product",
    "transition": "dark at product level to slightly lighter above",
    "purpose": "elegant, premium, depth"
  },
  "composition": {
    "symmetry": "product and reflection create balanced vertical composition",
    "negative_space": "ample space around product and reflection",
    "elegance": "minimal, sophisticated, high-end aesthetic"
  }
}
```

**Technique 4: Knolling Layout**

```json
{
  "technique": "knolling_flat_lay",
  "description": "Organized flat lay with product and complementary items arranged at 90-degree angles",
  "product": {
    "type": "wireless_headphones",
    "position": "center of composition",
    "orientation": "laid flat, viewed from directly above"
  },
  "complementary_items": [
    "Charging cable (parallel alignment)",
    "USB adapter (perpendicular to cable)",
    "Carrying case (alongside headphones)",
    "Phone or tablet (showing music app)",
    "Notepad and pen (organized parallel)",
    "Coffee cup (circular accent)"
  ],
  "arrangement": {
    "style": "everything aligned at 90-degree angles (parallel or perpendicular)",
    "spacing": "even gaps between all items",
    "organization": "perfectly arranged, intentional placement",
    "color_coordination": "matching or complementary color palette"
  },
  "camera": {
    "angle": "directly overhead (bird's eye view)",
    "distance": "all items visible in frame with breathing room",
    "perspective": "perfectly straight down (no parallax distortion)"
  },
  "surface": {
    "type": "clean solid color or wood/marble texture",
    "color": "white, light gray, natural wood, or marble",
    "texture": "subtle, doesn't distract from products"
  },
  "lighting": {
    "style": "even overhead lighting",
    "quality": "soft, no harsh shadows",
    "direction": "from all sides to eliminate shadows"
  },
  "mood": "organized, curated, lifestyle, aspirational"
}
```

